I walk to the kitchen.
I place the two cloth bags on the counter.
I open the bags.
I take the vegetables out.
I like fresh vegetables.
I look at the new bitter gourd.
I put the vegetables in the fridge.
There is a photo of my dog Lola on the fridge.
I see that photo.
I like Lola very much.
I take the rice and spices from the bag.
I put them in the cupboard.
Now my cupboards are not empty.
I look at my kitchen.
I like this kitchen.
Tonight I want a good dinner.
But today I want Kerala food.
I start cooking.
